  Description: Prerequisite Region - Saga Lands You have learned the secrets of taming
    the mighty mammoths and other megafauna of the far north. Perhaps these talents
    are a part of your people's traditional customs, or perhaps you sought out these
    massive animals of your own accord. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be
    to Constitution or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained
    in the Nature skill and the Animal Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Train
    Animal] skill feat.
